<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in South Kashmir are conducting counter-insurgency operations after reports of terrorist presence, while the Srinagar police chief leads a security review on intelligence sharing. In Manipur, Kuki and Naga leaders have agreed to a Christmas truce and a peace process, and tribal students are intensifying agitation for scholarship releases; a tragic ambulance collision killed a pregnant woman and a hooch-related fire claimed 17 lives. The Chhattisgarh government recovered a Maoist weapon dump in the Bijapur forests and killed a suspected KCP cadre, and Lateef Bhat was killed in Kulgam. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE45UkYzTGZfeXBvMGNVcC1wbFdMdUlzTzZvSlRTSS04Q2dGNU9fM1pvbkVBSnpVVTVLX1VXVE5xY2ViRTQwRW1BUENmT19VUU1KQlNwOGhKVHE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFAxQjJSRExUYVprOGdaOEQydUV0N01hRmRoT1pibHdIMHZvWk9UYTlVVW92Q2NyNWVLOHdBRmFFcjN4eDNCaUMwMGhhY1N6c0tHanM4amx1bVU3MkhDX1lhdV9XVDdjQ2tXcWtyenRmN1ZzZDV3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOUmt5MDhOaFFxNG5XZHRNZHA2RVZGTWtoRmRhOVZvZmZKdDVNOGdGangyZE5mV096VnBld1ZaanczUnVVV0owcXV4TWtjdGUxMVRoODZDS19KWjVPNUx5SXBaVlVURmRjaEVLNlBlZEZ0QnhJMnk2UzhIVk52bFpFWGZjZi16QmttNHVRNXo3dGFpX2RabUd6Vy1YZEdfdHRPQjNQaGR0SGg3anE5R0FqdEUyQVFOV3p4LWJldQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greater Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQbVNlbTY0eHV4eFF3azY3S0xTYzc5YmtjTk1kelhtYU53eDltdWxUREE3YXh6TEhrWndqW